<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank to issue warrants on CITIC.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank to issue warrants on CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said on</p>
<p>Tuesday it intended to issue 118 million American-style call</p>
<p>warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$41.10	  PREMIUM	  12.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.5096	 GEARING	  8.1X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  5.SEPT.97	 PAYDATE	  5.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   11.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$41.10	  MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
